		<string text="Aim by turning the controller, as you would a mouse; the stick still works too. Hold to Aim: only while the gyro button is held. Hold to Pause: except while it is held, to re-center. Thumb on Stick: while your thumb touches the right stick (a Steam Deck, a Steam Controller).|No aim assist on the gyro's aim."/>
		<string text="The button that Hold to Aim and Hold to Pause hold. It still does its own action too: Button Remapping can move that."/>
		<string text="How far the view turns for each degree you turn the controller: 1 as far, 2 twice as far. Press A, or click the number, to type a value.|Zoomed in: as Zoom Aim Speed sets."/>
		<string text="How far the view turns up and down, of how far it turns side to side. 1X turns it as far."/>
		<string text="Player Space turns you as you turn the controller about the up direction, however you hold it: flat, upright or between. Local Space turns you about the controller's own axis, as if held flat."/>
		<string text="Steadies the smallest motions, your hand's tremor, but never a real turn. Off: every motion as it comes."/>
		<string text="Put the controller down on something still, then select this: it measures the gyroscope at rest for a second and a half.|It also does so whenever it is held still."/>
